posts.text:
Judd Caulfield (birth of child), Nikita Klepov (scratch) and Nick Jensen (scratch) come out of the Ducks line-up on Long Island.

Nikita Nesterenko, Sam Colangelo and Drew Helleson draw back into the Anaheim line-up.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Mikael Granlund (upper body, day to day) is on the ice at Ducks practice in a regular jersey.

Joel Quenneville said yesterday that he’ll be on the four-game road trip and is expected to play.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Boston ties it up on the power play. Jackson LaCombe and Noah Warren tie up Bruins sticks around the crease thrice, but the puck pinballs back and forth until David Pastrnak pots the equalizer.

2-2, 16:34 to play in Anaheim.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Ducks grab the lead on an excellent round of forechecking from the fourth line. Long run of possession, and Tim Washe eventually nonchalantly slings it from the top of the zone and catches DiPietro by surprise.

1-0 Ducks

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether
